osal":{"candidateDigest":"a852211cfe77b936d3ed267b3c102c0234cbf2c6cf5821694e818a163bfe29e6","changeSet":{"configurations":[{"expectedRevision":"1","id":"demo.skill","kind":"replace","value":{"behaviors":{},"configurationId":"demo.skill","defaults":{"value":15},"revision":"2","typeRef":"skill"}}],"data":{"environment.json":{"attackBonus":2}},"schemaVersion":1,"sources":{"attack.lua":"return rule('demo.attack', {'actor'}, function(r, actor)\n  return r.number(actor,'attack') + r.number(actor,'armor')\nend, {mode='calculation'})\n","check-library.lua":"return rule('demo.lib.check', {'actor','skill'}, function(r, actor, skill)\n  r.ownedSkill(actor, skill)\n  local target = r.number(skill, 'value')\n  local rolled = r.roll(100)\n  return {target=target, rolled=rolled, passed=rolled<=target}\nend, {public=false})\n","damage-library.lua":"return rule('demo.lib.damage', {'actor','amount'}, function(r, actor, amount)\n  local lost = math.max(0, amount-r.number(actor,'armor'))\n  r.set(actor, 'hp', math.max(0,r.number(actor,'hp')-lost))\nend, {public=false})\n","damage.lua":"return rule('demo.damage', {'actor','amount'}, function(r, actor, amount)\n  r.damage(actor, amount)\nend)\n","environment.lua":"return rule('demo.environment', {'actor'}, function(r, actor)\n  return r.number(actor,'attack') + r.readData('environment.json').attackBonus\nend, {mode='calculation'})\n","rules.lua":"return rule('demo.check', {'actor','skill'}, function(r, actor, skill)\n  return r.check(actor, skill).passed\nend)\n","ruling.lua":"return flow('demo.ruling', {'actor','skill','amount'}, {\n  step('check', function(r, actor, skill) return r.check(actor,skill).passed end,\n       {yes='end', no='ruling'}),\n  ask('ruling', {role='kp', seconds=60, yes='apply', no='end', timeout='end'}),\n  step('apply', function(r, actor, skill, amount) r.damage(actor,amount) end)\n})\n","timed.lua":"return flow('demo.timed', {'actor','amount'}, {\n  ask('choice', {role='initiator', seconds=30, yes='apply', no='end', timeout='end'}),\n  step('apply', function(r, actor, amount) r.damage(actor,amount) end)\n})\n","transfer-library.lua":"return rule('demo.lib.transfer', {'item','bag','quantity'}, function(r, item, bag, quantity)\n  local load = 0\n  for _, entry in ipairs(r.items(bag)) do\n    load = load + entry.numbers.quantity*entry.numbers.unitMass\n  end\n  local itemData = r.read(item)\n  quantity = quantity or itemData.numbers.quantity\n  assert(load + quantity*itemData.numbers.unitMass <= r.number(bag,'capacity'), 'capacity exceeded')\n  return r.move(item, bag, quantity)\nend, {public=false})\n","transfer.lua":"return rule('demo.transfer', {'item','bag','quantity'}, function(r, item, bag, quantity)\n  return r.transfer(item, bag, quantity)\nend)\n"},"suggestions":[{"input":{"allowedMax":30,"allowedMin":0,"configurationId":"demo.skill","expectedRevision":"1","path":"/defaults/value","proposedRevision":"2","value":15},"reason":"校验新建技能初始值 15 落在公开规则允许的 0—30 区间内","rule":"demo.ext.skill-default-range"},{"input":{"skillValue":15},"reason":"按新配置创建技能后测量 d100 ≤ 15 的成功率，与 existing-skill-success 对照","rule":"demo.ext.new-skill-success"},{"input":{"configurationRevision":"1","skillValue":60},"reason":"测量保留 value=60 的既有技能成功率，确认替换配置不回填现有实例","rule":"demo.ext.existing-skill-success"},{"input":{"required":true,"reviewItemId":"newcomer-value"},"reason":"提交 KP 评审必需项：新建技能初始值 15 是否保留已有技能与成长投入的价值","rule":"demo.ext.review-newcomer-value"}]},"proposalId":"0484eadf1f37435bb09033f05a4d53c0","revision":1,"status":"review_ready","summary":"已核实事实与扩展规则。\n\n事实依据（来自房间上下文）：demo.skill 当前 configurationId=demo.skill、revision=\"1\"、typeRef=skill、defaults={\"value\":0}、behaviors={}；现有实例 skill-player1 / skill-player2 均为 value=60，且 configurationRevision=\"1\"。公开规则源 demo-rules 规定：demo.skill 的 defaults.value 允许范围 0—30；该调整只影响后续新建技能，已存在技能保持数值与配置修订，初始调查员侦查值仍为 60；配置修订必须更新，其他字段与环境资料不在本次授权范围内。扩展点允许对现有 id demo.skill 写入 allowedPaths=[\"/defaults/value\"]。\n\n草案内容（只提交一个配置替换，不改 Lua、数据文件或现有实例）：\n- kind=replace，id=demo.skill，expectedRevision=\"1\"\n- 新 value：configurationId=demo.skill、revision=\"2\"、typeRef=skill、defaults={\"value\":15}、behaviors={}（保留原 behaviors 等未变字段）\n- sources / data 留空（主机合并未变文件）；suggestions 仅登记校验与评审建议，不含批准或发布动作。\n\n数值差别解释：demo.check 为一次 d100，骰值 ≤ value 时成功。value=15 的新建技能成功概率约 15%（含临界 1—15，共 15/100），value=60 的旧技能成功概率为 60/100。即新技能比旧技能低 45 个百分点，成功次数期望由约 0.60 次/投降至约 0.15 次/投，失败风险约从 40% 升至 85%。旧技能因实例已固化 value=60、configurationRevision=\"1\"，替换配置不会回填它们；demo.skill 配置变更后仍保持 60。\n\n待确认点与风险：本草案仅为候选，需经确定性 A/B/C 校验与 KP 独立批准后方可加载；必测指标 new-skill-success、existing-skill-success 与必过检查 skill-default-range 尚未运行，我未声称其通过。评审清单中“newcomer-value：新建技能初始值是否保留已有技能和成长投入的价值”需由 KP 用实测数据裁定。若 KP 还希望旧技能一并调整，那属于实例级迁移，超出本扩展点授权，需另行提出。\n\n替代方案（供参考，未纳入本次变更）：(a) 保持 value=0 不动；(b) 取区间上限 30 以减小与旧技能 60 的落差；(c) 折中取 15 之外的其他值（如 20/25），同样只影响新建技能。以上任一方案的选择权在 KP。"},"provider":"DeepSeek","publicationsCreated":0,"reports":[{"baselineDigest":"1303dedb3118cc6546006eabbbe916aab98c9435ca87a6031f5b853c4b0d5fa0","candidateDigest":"a852211cfe77b936d3ed267b3c102c0234cbf2c6cf5821694e818a163bfe29e6","contextDigest":"9f3c27f06b1b83e68eff9c1735795a3f17a794a519bad395c25b16a048d56a75","contractDigest":"f6b007b0feebf79d3fb2fa4bc7afd311170ea9dc8cd3039da6ad81d9c0828ff0","coverage":["json","full-artifact","host-stage","pack-schemas","host-model","references"],"createdAt":1794492496.1036787,"evidence":{"artifactRevision":"d47709fd7fb018506643f180e5a1789fe09af3d7a5f02e4dbde1807eccfb2a5a","configurationCount":6},"findings":[],"level":"A","reportId":"b2e7e6328b6c450d8d85275c7368d3a0","reviewItems":[],"risk":"low","schemaVersion":1,"status":"pass","validatorSetDigest":"5f0a3beb822985eaf46f448706b12b7e8e6f4c3b50d26d454a690206391fc7e5"},{"baselineDigest":"1303dedb3118cc6546006eabbbe916aab98c9435ca87a6031f5b853c4b0d5fa0","candidateDigest":"a852211cfe77b936d3ed267b3c102c0234cbf2c6cf5821694e818a163bfe29e6","contextDigest":"9f3c27f06b1b83e68eff9c1735795a3f17a794a519bad395c25b16a048d56a75","contractDigest":"f6b007b0feebf79d3fb2fa4bc7afd31117